{"sha": "59ba9ec7a630a7123469ca46ccbcd15ba878560dd7868a7b58ded10c17ddd064", "body": ["渐近情形：设 $x(t)$ 始于 $B(\\bar x, \\delta)$；", "$V(x(t))$ 递减趋于某个 $c \\geq 0$。若 $c > 0$：轨线", "停留在 $K = \\{x \\in \\bar B(\\bar x,", "\\varepsilon): V(x) \\geq c\\}$，这是一个紧集，并且排除了", "$\\bar x$ 的一个邻域（$V$ 连续且 $V(\\bar x)", "= 0 < c$）。在 $K$ 上，函数 $\\dot V$ 连续，", "严格为负，故 $\\mu = \\max_K\\dot V < 0$", "（由紧性）；于是 $V(x(t)) \\leq V(x(0)) + \\mu t \\to", "-\\infty$：与 $V \\geq 0$ 矛盾。因此", "$c = 0$，且 $x(t) \\to \\bar x$（球内距离满足 $\\geq", "\\rho$ 者，即距 $\\bar x$ 的点，满足 $V \\geq m_\\rho >", "0$）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[线性化稳定性]", "\\label{thm:b3:ode:linearization}", "设 $F$ 为 $\\mathcal C^1$ 函数，$F(\\bar x) = 0$，$A = DF(\\bar x)$。", "若 $A$ 的每个特征值都满足 $\\operatorname{Re}\\lambda <", "0$，则 $\\bar x$ 渐近稳定。\\index{线性化", "稳定性}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将 $\\bar x$ 平移到 $0$，并写 $F(x) = Ax + g(x)$，其中", "$g(x) = o(\\norm x)$（$\\mathcal C^1$ 可微性）。取", "$\\alpha > 0$ 使得 $\\vertiii{\\eu^{tA}} \\leq C\\eu^{-\\alpha t}$", "（$t \\geq 0$；\\cref{thm:b3:ode:matrixexp}），再取 $r > 0$，使得", "$\\norm{g(x)} \\leq \\frac{\\alpha}{2C}\\norm x$，当 $\\norm x \\leq", "r$ 时。对 $b(s) = g(x(s))$ 使用杜阿梅尔公式：", "\\[", "x(t) = \\eu^{tA}x_0 + \\int_0^t\\eu^{(t-s)A}g(x(s))\\,\\dd s,", "\\]", "只要 $\\norm{x(s)} \\leq r$ 即成立。记 $u(t) =", "\\eu^{\\alpha t}\\norm{x(t)}$ 满足", "\\[", "u(t) \\leq C\\norm{x_0} +", "\\int_0^{t}C\\,\\frac{\\alpha}{2C}\\,u(s)\\,\\dd s ,", "\\]", "由格朗沃尔不等式得 $u(t) \\leq C\\norm{x_0}\\eu^{\\alpha t/2}$，", "即 $\\norm{x(t)} \\leq C\\norm{x_0}\\eu^{-\\alpha t/2}$。若", "$\\norm{x_0} < r/C$，则先验界使 $\\norm{x(t)} <", "r$ 对所有 $t$ 成立（连续性/自举论证：", "满足 $\\norm x \\leq r$ 的时刻集合在", "$\\intco0{T_+}$ 中既开又闭（由严格估计），解是", "整体的，并以指数速度收敛到 $0$：渐近", "稳定。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}\\label{met:b3:ode:strategy}", "面对一个常微分方程：(1) 存在唯一性——检验局部", "利普希茨（通常为 $\\mathcal C^1$）；(2) 整体性——线性", "增长、有界性，或借助李雅普诺夫", "函数或首次积分得到的不变紧集；若不成立，怀疑爆破，", "并用标量漫画 $x' = x^2$ 检验；(3) 线性", "系统——预解式、杜阿梅尔公式，常系数情形下", "考察 $A$ 的特征结构；(4) 定性", "问题——平衡点、线性化，并寻找李雅普诺夫", "函数（系统为力学系统时取能量），或首次积分，其水平集", "能够围住轨线。周末", "问题通过单摆完整地演示了这一方法。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=11cm, height=6cm,", "    xmin=-7.2, xmax=7.2, ymin=-2.9, ymax=2.9,", "    xtick={-6.2832, -3.1416, 0, 3.1416, 6.2832},", "    xticklabels={$-2\\pi$, $-\\pi$, $0$, $\\pi$, $2\\pi$},", "    ytick={-2,0,2}]", "  % oscillations: E<1 : y = +-sqrt(2(E+cos x)), E = -0.3, 0.5", "  \\foreach \\E in {-0.3, 0.5}{", "    \\addplot[omDef, samples=200, domain=-7.2:7.2]", "      {sqrt(max(0, 2*(\\E + cos(deg(x)))))};", "    \\addplot[omDef, samples=200, domain=-7.2:7.2]", "      {-sqrt(max(0, 2*(\\E + cos(deg(x)))))};", "  }", "  % separatrix E = 1", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, samples=300, domain=-7.2:7.2]", "    {sqrt(max(0, 2*(1 + cos(deg(x)))))};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, samples=300, domain=-7.2:7.2]", "    {-sqrt(max(0, 2*(1 + cos(deg(x)))))};", "  % rotations E > 1", "  \\foreach \\E in {1.6, 2.4}{", "    \\addplot[omProp, samples=200, domain=-7.2:7.2]", "      {sqrt(2*(\\E + cos(deg(x))))};", "    \\addplot[omProp, samples=200, domain=-7.2:7.2]", "      {-sqrt(2*(\\E + cos(deg(x))))};", "  }", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 单摆 $x'' = -\\sin x$ 在", "$(x, x')$ 平面上的相图：能量 $E = \\frac{x'^2}2", "- \\cos x$ 的水平曲线。闭曲线（蓝色）：振动，$E < 1$；", "旋转曲线（橙色）：整周旋转，$E > 1$；二者之间", "为\\emph{分界线}（红色），$E = 1$，连接", "不稳定平衡点 $(\\pm\\pi, 0)$。周末问题证明了", "这幅图所暗示的一切。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:ode:1}", "显式求解并确定极大区间：", "(a) $x' = x^2$，$x(0) = 1$；(b) $x' = 1 + x^2$，$x(0) = 0$；", "(c) $x' = x(1-x)$，$x(0) = \\frac12$。将每个答案与", "\\cref{thm:b3:ode:maximal}(2) 及", "\\cref{cor:b3:ode:globallinear} 对照。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}